sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant API as Flask API
    participant Extractor as Modality Extractor
    participant PredService as PredictionService
    participant Intel as Intelligence Pipeline
    participant Evid as EvidenceService
    
    User->>Frontend: Uploads File (PDF, Image, Audio)
    Frontend->>API: POST /predict/file (multipart/form-data)
    
    API->>Extractor: extract_text_from_file(tmp_path)
    
    alt is PDF / TXT
        Extractor->>Extractor: Parse with pdfplumber / native
    else is Image (PNG/JPG)
        Extractor->>Extractor: OCR with EasyOCR + OpenCV
    else is Audio/Video (MP3/MP4)
        Extractor->>Extractor: Transcribe with OpenAI Whisper
    end
    
    Extractor-->>API: Extracted String
    
    API->>PredService: predict_text(extracted_string)
    
    PredService->>Intel: Run ML Models & Threat Intel
    Intel-->>PredService: Raw Results
    
    PredService->>Evid: generate_evidence_plan(result)
    Evid->>Evid: Evaluate Job/Recruitment Scam Patterns
    Evid-->>PredService: Forensic Evidence Plan
    
    PredService-->>API: Analysis JSON
    API-->>Frontend: 200 OK (JSON)
    Frontend-->>User: Display Threat Hunt Results
